  Mode: 48
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Breakwater
  Description: Sparrows only, against fourteen walls. Every station is a dish of
    plates with its throat welded shut - a triple weave of danger bars around an
    eye barely wider than your hull. You arrive with two rockets and one choice -
    blow a door, stop dead and saw one open in turret stance, or thread the eye
    and take nothing with you. Prisms buy rockets, so the wall you just opened
    pays for the next one. First team to put a pilot through the last station
    takes it.
